        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.0.82</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:58:04 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot</link>
            <sparkle:version>282</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.82</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[修复冻结截图蒙层位于标注画布上方、导致箭头、文字、形状和马赛克绘制后不可见的问题，标注现在会在绘制过程中即时显示。

优化原位标注界面的选区边缘操作：外侧缩放容错保持 20 pt，内侧缩至 5 pt，减少对画布标注操作的干扰。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot/releases/download/v2.0.82/SuperScreenshot-v2.0.82-Universal.zip" length="3062414" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="uqekvFw3QwtXc76Ou2s38opV/3weduyD/gLFz5CMxHlF1NGjQsAsliLAg1Ao2eJJAzcrMfTMKMR/PbPd0srSCw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.0.80</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:20:48 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot</link>
            <sparkle:version>280</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.80</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[修复截图选区内会透出底层实时桌面的问题。触发截图后，所有显示器会立即冻结，选区和标注阶段始终显示触发瞬间的静态画面。

选择录屏或长截图时仍会解除画面冻结，以便继续捕获实时内容。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot/releases/download/v2.0.80/SuperScreenshot-v2.0.80-Universal.zip" length="3061660" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7Vp11IC2H8Bm4x8M8RvIgf1c4HDnInU7nE5/quv3mJur/x4RQpqYK7nrr+BI6gTFFNJABbFkxbEce1GCCJCOAg=="/>
